EXTERNAL Name(charname)

{Name("Yurei")}
Oh. My. Gosh. How did you know I love pinecone?!

{Name("Ankoku")}
Woah Yurei, I’ve never seen you happy like this!

{Name("Yurei")}
Ugh, me?! Happy!? Absolutely effing not.

{Name("Ankoku")}
Admit it Yurei, you like this village don’t you.

{Name("Yurei")}
Rana, thank you, for going out of your way to do something nice while I was being so angry.

{Name("Rana")}
Uh, you’re welcome. (calm down it's just a drink)

{Name("Yurei")}
Sorry, It’s just that I lost my family when I was a little kid, when I’m angry I don't have to be sad. But I guess I can't just be mean and angry forever. But I can’t be sad forever.

{Name("Rana")}
Well, I’m glad you liked the drink?

{Name("Yurei")}
Let’s go Ankoku, we have orphans to help.

{Name("Ankoku")}
Believe it!